			<div class="content" id="post-content-4839408">
									

<p>It definitely sounds like some decent improvements. It would be interesting to see this done up as a series of tales, possibly with Coyote playing tag with The Foundation. And definitely keep the first encounter; my notes were more that it just felt like there were several different SCPs at work rather than a single; this version would make it a single SCP, with the tales being a manifestation of Coyote.</p>
<p>Variation on a theme: &quot;Containment&quot; doesn't always mean that the SCP is neutralized or is even that it's dragged kicking and screaming into an underground pen. Sometimes The Foundation is content if the SCP disappears into the woodwork, and in this case, they may be willing to accept the loss if it gets rid of him, especially if they have a general idea where he is.</p>

